  "summary": {
    "zh": "这是一款面向跨境渠道的YS儿童DIY插珠帐篷拼搭套装，支持多场景搭建与互动玩法，适用于家庭、课堂与活动空间布置。\n\n品牌为尧顺，产地东莞茶山，支持加工定制与导购视频展示，适合渠道批量供货。",
    "en": "This is a YS kids DIY fort set designed for cross-border channels. It supports multi-scene construction and interactive play for homes, classrooms, and activity-space setups.\n\nBrand: Yaoshun. Origin: Chashan, Dongguan. Custom processing and guide video support are available for channel bulk supply."
  },
  "description": {
    "zh": [
      "该款YS儿童DIY插珠帐篷拼搭套装采用杆件与连接球组合结构，适合搭建帐篷、堡垒和游戏空间，便于在家庭和教学场景中开展互动活动。",
      "产品支持加工定制与多功能组合，可按渠道需求进行配置。品牌为尧顺，定位跨境供货，适用于电商和分销渠道上架。",
      "商品采用彩盒包装，规格为65夜光杆+35紫色多边球，包装重量2300g，适合批量采购和长期供货。"
    ],
    "en": [
      "This YS kids DIY set uses a rod-and-connector structure to build tents, forts, and playable spaces for interactive home and educational scenarios.",
      "The product supports custom processing and multi-function configuration based on channel requirements. Brand: Yaoshun. It is positioned for cross-border supply and channel listing.",
      "Packed in a color box, the configuration is 65 glow rods + 35 purple connector balls with a 2300g package weight, suitable for bulk procurement and long-term supply."
    ]
  },
